Bundled LZ4 source for gem5 FTR trace support.

Version: v1.10.0
Origin: https://github.com/lz4/lz4/tree/v1.10.0/lib
Files copied:
- lz4.c
- lz4.h
- LICENSE

Update process:
1. Replace lz4.c and lz4.h from a newer upstream `lib/` directory.
2. Replace LICENSE from upstream `lib/LICENSE`.
3. Rebuild `build/<ISA>/gem5.opt`.
